# npm run dev: the backend (backend/: npm run dev on :4000, proxied as /api).
# Only the modules listed are on; the others (requirements, test cases, runs, defects, calendar,
# documents, reports, audit logs, notifications …) are hidden until the backend has them.
# npm run dev:mock runs everything on the mock instead.
VITE_API_MODE=rest
VITE_API_REST=auth,user,role,team,project,settings,file
